{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "f0e905b3fdcebe3ec3503f52f8f46a359aa93d251c927c332aecc07dabef5a68", "ja": "自分を信じるための時間", "zh": "相信自己的时间", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "50f248ab0e91e138fb6e8d236e8d22690535b8a5999b641e62242457b79a311c", "ja": "残すは生放送ライブのみ。紗代子は緊張と\n不安で身をすくませるが、プロデューサーの\n言葉により積み重ねてきた練習を振り返り\nそれを自信にして立ち直る。本番、紗代子は\nTVで最高の笑顔を披露するのだった。", "zh": "只剩下现场直播了。纱代子因紧张和不安而缩成一团，但在制作人的话语下，她回顾了自己日积月累的练习，并将其化为自信，重新振作起来。正式演出时，纱代子在电视上展现出了最棒的笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_1000_null", "source_sha256": "e0721d758908ef503485a7d32381b68518f486e7ce43ed61085b1a29dc5cfb98", "ja": "朝の情報番組『地元からオハヨー！』放送中……", "zh": "早间资讯节目《来自家乡的早安！》播出中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_1001_401pro", "source_sha256": "cada0f57739874dca93c4653bb5a969398259bf3ecd022f64240b81d01622b4f", "ja": "よし、みんなのコーナーはバッチリだったな。\nあとは、生放送ライブを残すのみだ！", "zh": "好，大家的环节都非常完美。\n接下来，就只剩现场直播的Live了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "e6257429d66dd28f7ec3be80470cb86a7ad32077f47f3b2cdfb3f1fdde024a52", "ja": "……。\n生放送で、ライブ……。", "zh": "……。\n现场直播演出……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "ace99dcd0abf425f1b09af4c77bbd40736e30c3ae0417ca42d9da80abf80e93c", "ja": "あの、プロデューサー……失敗したら、\nそれも全部放送されるってこと、ですよね……？", "zh": "那个，制作人……要是搞砸了，\n也会全都被播出去，对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_1004_401pro", "source_sha256": "74c48766ddd742e4fbba13bed0920cd0abc29abdb59cd008e60b3214d55b756b", "ja": "え。……ああ、生放送のライブなんて初めてだもんな。\n不安になるような言い方をして、申し訳ない。", "zh": "诶……啊，毕竟是第一次参加直播演出嘛。\n用让你感到不安的说法，我很抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "08f95f56387edb4a7364215c6786008e47eec74e3a153feaac5bad1ae9663d5b", "ja": "い、いえ、そんな！　私がダメなんです。\n弱気な言葉を、口にしてしまって。", "zh": "没、没有那回事！是我自己不够坚强。\n竟然说出了这么丧气的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_1006_401pro", "source_sha256": "2b7b5143080cf55d5ae9ce4609ff3a5c0eb58331ea6ed5e9e89e8c810183cca2", "ja": "……。でも、紗代子は誰よりも真面目に、\nレッスンに取り組んでいたじゃないか。", "zh": "……但是，纱代子在练习时，\n明明比谁都要认真努力啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_1007_401pro", "source_sha256": "20ad5d41c5a9c5855777ebd427a167ce6599c6e49aa169bc3496d645533e4e0f", "ja": "普段のレッスンだけじゃなくて、自主トレだって\nいつも最後まで残って、頑張ってたよな？", "zh": "不只是平时的课程，自主训练也是，\n你总是坚持到最后，一直在努力，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "c07312ff5d1d1a3c64348ac9e63b31e007c27dcb18d7a214169f57aa80877a7e", "ja": "……私、不器用なんです。だから、\n人一倍練習をしなくちゃいけないと思って……。", "zh": "……我不太擅长这些。所以，我觉得自己必须比别人加倍努力练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "1bb084daf1f74f3a90250e6405375970babdff133b936e17cf17aa6f7edd719c", "ja": "準備を頑張ることは得意なんですよ。\n……でも、本番は全然、得意じゃなくて……。", "zh": "我很擅长努力做好准备。\n……可是正式演出就完全不擅长了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "9f4c65979beac008b25e277a9cd8b59dc1ae9c942ab60e0ffb22ea8207b93bb1", "ja": "ダメですね。私、リーダーなのに。\nレッスンを頑張るだけで、本番ではこんな……。", "zh": "不行啊。我明明是队长。\n光顾着努力练习，到了正式演出却变成这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_1011_401pro", "source_sha256": "ff9cdaf38e5219f81e76e7437ae13df7da981451b93f6600961002a05020506b", "ja": "……。レッスンはもちろん、歌やダンスを\nしっかり身につけるためにやることだと思う。", "zh": "……训练固然是为了能切实掌握\n唱歌和跳舞的技巧而进行的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_1012_401pro", "source_sha256": "9e47f54d38cd5182ee11d0b7755c76c4bf9beec52bcef26b2b2c44aeae143f25", "ja": "でも同時に、自分を信じられるようになるための、\n大事な、かけがえのない時間でもあると思うんだ。", "zh": "但与此同时，我也觉得，这是让自己学会相信自己的、重要而无可替代的时光。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "691ee9855cd084fbe252561fa1e947abbedb581d9f75ca331c3f472450601197", "ja": "……。\n自分を信じられるようになるための、時間……。", "zh": "……。\n能让自己变得相信自己的，时间……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_1014_401pro", "source_sha256": "33d2acd061f271fb8cd735acba3a5ba2a5f33640d2ff78c47f7e7599471b5253", "ja": "紗代子は誰よりもそれを積み重ねたんだ。\nその分だけ、自分を信じてもいいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "紗代子比任何人都更加不断积累了那段时光。既然付出了那么多，相信自己也是理所当然的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_1015_401pro", "source_sha256": "c8b4686adc3abaca824c62b1b8fbf140140df5fa656da1a36bb1f28b70df87fd", "ja": "少なくとも、ずっと紗代子を見てきた俺や\n5thのみんなは、もうすっかり紗代子を信じてるぞ！", "zh": "至少，一直看着纱代子的我和\n5th的大家，早就完全信任你了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "6ee0920cea4a358828527605dc95c0acfe83301408087bc5588713c3241cab21", "ja": "プロデューサー……。", "zh": "制作人……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "3c6f5cd6dfa8bf29933daa61b88244817a222313d230af718d12f476cf03cfb6", "ja": "そうですよね。失敗は怖いけど……。だからって\n身を縮めていたら、一歩も前に進めないですよね。", "zh": "是啊。虽然害怕失败……可是，如果因为这样就畏缩不前，也就一步都走不出去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "86b9910f2d09dad8dae6f0d9eec44d986e04dc0ca2d2e620d3156d27219fef22", "ja": "あ、原っぱライブもそうでした。未来ちゃん達が\nできるって信じて、前に進んでくれたから……。", "zh": "啊，草地上的演出也是这样。因为未来她们相信自己能做到，勇敢地向前迈进了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "3c6eeca6e931c9c62cfca0dceee7ae868b1da32b9ec03dda22e204e220907d01", "ja": "うん。大事なのは、きっと……\n信じる勇気……！", "zh": "嗯。最重要的，一定是……\n相信的勇气……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_1020_401pro", "source_sha256": "f3bdb9e97dd5d0a8762e3ca627b0004086a9ad2b5a3f711ac7d0e06ed3a8829c", "ja": "……いい顔になったな、紗代子！", "zh": "……表情变得很棒了呢，纱代子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_1021_027say", "source_sha256": "9458afe6ab6c3b2338adcfb35240bbcf05c48dddb16a1b5ef84f684bcd0cbaed", "ja": "はいっ！　プロデューサー、私、完璧にできるって\n言い切るほどの自信は、やっぱり、ありませんけど……", "zh": "是！制作人，虽然我还没有自信断言自己能完美做到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_1022_027say", "source_sha256": "35c6876928471377d9bbd8cf68a4c4fc6a128d32066370a7307b8ce17f513a1d", "ja": "最後までやり抜く自信はあります！\nたくさん、たくさん練習しましたから！", "zh": "我有坚持到最后的自信！\n因为我练习了好多好多次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_1023_401pro", "source_sha256": "e6524759a377b53152e7909fc41f0a113e10fb2df19151cc97613e8319517702", "ja": "うん！\n最後まで、紗代子達の全力を見せてくれ！", "zh": "嗯！\n坚持到最后，让我看看紗代子她们的全力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_1024_027say", "source_sha256": "5b2ed562b675715a9fb6f5a302fd77e1a5c371df2b2afe69a2fc1515f0a484cb", "ja": "おはようございます！　今日が素敵な一日になるように\n私たちが全力で、みなさんを応援します！", "zh": "早上好！为了让今天成为美好的一天，\n我们会全力为大家加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_05_1025_027say", "source_sha256": "795c412aaaf051b68d090796b55aad7afdbfe48d5bb01b35a2b6d4c99130bad9", "ja": "それでは聞いてください。\nMILLIONSTARS Team5thで、『バトンタッチ』！", "zh": "那么请欣赏。\n由MILLIONSTARS Team5th带来《接力棒》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
